---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="SEO | Technical Optimization, Content & Strategy | Valorferrum"
  description="SEO freelancer for technical optimization, content strategy & sustainable rankings. For SMEs, startups & NGOs."
  lang="en"
>
  <section class="pt-32 pb-24 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <div class="mb-12 reveal">
        <a href="/en/services/" class="text-sm text-text-muted hover:text-primary transition-colors mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M19 12H5M12 19l-7-7 7-7"/></svg>
          All Services
        </a>
        <h1 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-6">SEO</h1>
        <p class="text-text-secondary text-lg">Technical, content-based & strategic. No quick-fix marketing, just solid work that lasts.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-12">
        <div class="reveal p-6 rounded-xl bg-surface border border-border">
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary mb-3">Technical SEO</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">Core Web Vitals, crawl budget, indexing, Schema.org, canonicals, hreflang. Clean foundation for everything else.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal p-6 rounded-xl bg-surface border border-border" style="transition-delay:100ms">
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary mb-3">Content Strategy</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">Keyword research, topic clusters, content gaps, E-E-A-T. Content that doesn't just rank, but convinces.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal p-6 rounded-xl bg-surface border border-border" style="transition-delay:200ms">
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary mb-3">Onpage & Offpage</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">Meta data, internal linking, backlink analysis, digital PR. Sustainable, not manipulative.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal p-6 rounded-xl bg-surface border border-border" style="transition-delay:300ms">
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary mb-3">Local & E-Commerce</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">Google Business Profile, local pack, product SEO, category optimization. For local visibility and shops.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal p-8 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-primary/10 to-spectrum-pink/10 border border-primary/20 text-center">
        <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-4">Pricing & Process</h3>
        <p class="text-text-secondary mb-6">SEO audit from 890€. Monthly support on hourly basis or fixed price. No bloated packages.</p>
        <a href="/en/contact/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-3 rounded-lg bg-primary text-white font-semibold hover:brightness-110 transition-all">Request Project</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>